      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4374,
      "text": "They said, “O magician, call upon your Lord for us, by virtue of the covenant He has made with you[18]; we will surely accept guidance.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4375,
      "text": "But as soon We removed the punishment from them, they broke their promise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4376,
      "text": "Pharaoh proclaimed to his people, saying, “O my people, does not the kingdom of Egypt belong to me, and these streams[19] flowing at my feet? Do you not see?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4377,
      "text": "Or am I not better than this contemptible one who can hardly express himself[20]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4378,
      "text": "Then why are there not sent down upon him bracelets of gold or come with him angels to support him?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4379,
      "text": "Thus he made a fool of his people and they obeyed him. They were indeed a wicked people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 54,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4380,
      "text": "When they angered Us, We exacted Our retribution and drowned them all.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 55,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4381,
      "text": "Thus We made them a precedent and a lesson[21] for the later generations.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 56,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 428,
      "hizbQuarter": 197,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4382,
      "text": "When the example of the son of Mary was given, your people laughed and jeered[22],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 57,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4383,
      "text": "and they said, “Are Our gods better or he[23]?” They only mentioned him to you for the sake of argument. They are indeed a contentious people.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 58,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 493,
      "ruku": 429,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4384,
      "text": "He was only a slave whom We[24] favored and made him an example for the Children of Israel.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 43,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الزُّخۡرُفِ",
        "englishName": "Az-Zukhruf",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Ornaments of gold",
        "numberOfAyahs": 89,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 59,
      "juz": 25,
